# The types of the IRIs an entity's triples mention, so the OWLAPI parses each as the kind of entity it is (DESIGN.md
# §2.8). Only named types: an anonymous one (an individual's class expression) would come without its triples.
# browl.axioms fills in the IRIs, and adds the dataset clause before WHERE.
CONSTRUCT { ?iri rdf:type ?type }
WHERE {
  VALUES ?iri { }
  ?iri rdf:type ?type
  FILTER isIRI(?type)
}
